OL,3,GNEWSARepeat offender fined for
OL,4,Asearching for gold in protected river
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gold panner caught illegally
OL,7,Fsearching for gold in a protected river
OL,8,Fhas been ordered to pay fines and costs
OL,9,Ftotalling more than #4,700, a regulator
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FBrian Wright, 68, had been caught
OL,13,Fpanning at Afon Wen river near
OL,14,FDolgellau, Gwynedd, in October and
OL,15,FDecember 2024.
OL,17,FHe was found guilty of environmental
OL,18,Foffences at Llandudno Magistrate's
OL,19,FCourt on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
