OL,3,GNEWSARepeat offender fined for
OL,4,Asearching for gold in protected river
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnvironment body Natural Resources
OL,7,FWales (NRW) said Wright had been caught
OL,8,Fdisturbing the "protected and valued
OL,9,Fenvironment" of Coed y Brenin Forest,
OL,10,Fwhich the river runs through, and was a
OL,11,Frepeat offender.
